[l_english.STATE_LORE_66]
The new Griffonstone was originally an inconspicuous hill, separating the fertile Griffonica Plain from the barren Infernal Lands to the east. But when the proud Griffons ended their centuries-long civil war and looked back at the world, the eastern wasteland had become unimaginable to them — treasures from three continents were being transported across oceans and mountains to the backyards of those centaur nobles, and the Griffons, who once dominated the skies, had to reassess their position.
Shortly after the war ended, the small villages here established the first centaur settlements. As the Griffon’s exotic treasures flowed into the centaur territories from this checkpoint, the population of the residents grew larger and larger, and towns with mixed Griffon and centaur populations gradually formed. Then, the centaurs only needed to lie on their office sofa and casually draw a few crooked lines on the map with a pencil, and the Griffon Kingdom was divided into two. The original Griffon Lords’ Council was no longer recognized, and this place became a satellite state between the centaurs and Griffons. The once bustling town was thus named “New Griffonstone”.
As for the new supreme ruler of New Griffonstone, the Chief Lord of the New Griffon Council, the Honorable Centaur, Gustave le Grand, he is... just a cook. With his exquisite culinary skills and his world-renowned éclairs, Gustave won the favor of the centaur upper class — a famous high-society Griffon, yet with a political background and ambition of zero, he is no doubt the perfect puppet choice. Gustave le Grand never practices despotism, never persecutes his compatriots, never indulges in pleasure, never wages war. All he ever does is make sure those centaurs who do so are well-fed and well-drunk.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_66]
新狮鹫岩原本只是一座不起眼的小山，分隔着土壤肥沃的狮鹫尼加平原与东部贫瘠的炼狱之地。但当高傲的狮鹫们结束了数百年的内战重新看向世界的时候，东方的荒芜之地已经变得他们无法想象 — 三片大陆的财宝跨越海洋与山脉输送向那些半人马贵族的后院，曾经称霸天空的狮鹫们也不得不重新审视自己的地位。
战争结束后不久，这里的小村庄建立了第一片半人马定居点。随着狮鹫的奇珍异宝们纷纷从这个关卡流入半人马的领地，这里的居民规模也越来越大，狮鹫与半人马混居的城镇逐渐形成。随后，那些半人马只需要躺在办公室的沙发上，用铅笔在地图上随意画上几条七扭八歪的线，狮鹫王国就被一分为二。原本的狮鹫领主议会被拒绝承认，这里也成为了半人马与狮鹫中间的卫星国，当初最热闹的小镇也因此被冠名“新狮鹫岩”。
至于新狮鹫岩新的至高统治者，新狮鹫议会首席领主，荣誉半人马，伟大者古斯塔夫，他不过是个厨子罢了。凭借着精妙厨艺和他那享誉天下的éclairs，古斯塔夫赢得了半人马上层的青睐 — 一位明星级上流社会狮鹫，却又有着高达0的政治资历与野心，他简直是完美的傀儡人选。这位伟大者从不推行暴政、从不迫害同胞、从不沉迷享乐、从不穷兵黩武，他只不过是负责让那些这样做了的半人马们吃好喝好而已。
